# Test: a live edit of service { image-server } reaches the image server.
# Initial config: image-server enabled with image-directory img-a.
# After SIGHUP:   image-directory is img-b, nothing else changes.
# Expected: imageserver installs the reloaded config at apply, logs it with the
#           new image directory, and serves a file that only img-b holds.
#
# VALIDATES: spec-plugin-reload-applies-or-refuses row 26, AC-1: imageserver's
#            verify/apply pair replaces its HTTP servers for the reloaded
#            config (imageServer.install), and an HTTP GET is answered from
#            the new directory.
# PREVENTS: the acked-and-dropped reload. With OnConfigure alone, the SDK
#           answers config-apply OK and calls nothing, so the commit succeeded
#           while the server kept serving the boot image-directory.
#
# DISCRIMINATION: client/http-get fetches /install/image/only-in-b.img until
# the body arrives, and the test asserts its OK line. Only img-b holds the
# file, and only the apply handler moves the server there: with OnConfigure
# alone every fetch answers 404, the client fails, and the "img-b"
# expectation fails too. That an edit elsewhere under service replaces no
# server is proven in Go by TestConfigTxUnchangedSubtreeIsNoop
# (imageserver/config_tx_test.go). No listen-interface is named, so the server
# binds every address on the leased port, which a reload must bind or fail
# (R-13); imageserver-reload-unbindable-interface-refused proves the failure.
# Both directories are relative, so they resolve in the test's own directory,
# where the tmpfs blocks below write them.

option=env:var=ze.log.imageserver:value=info

stdin=ze-bgp:terminator=EOF_CONF
service {
	image-server {
		enabled true
		listen-port $PORT
		image-directory img-a
	}
}
EOF_CONF

tmpfs=config2.conf:terminator=EOF_CONF2
service {
	image-server {
		enabled true
		listen-port $PORT
		image-directory img-b
	}
}
EOF_CONF2

tmpfs=img-a/only-in-a.img:terminator=EOF_A
content-of-img-a
EOF_A

tmpfs=img-b/only-in-b.img:terminator=EOF_B
content-of-img-b
EOF_B

cmd=background:seq=1:exec=le test fixture reload/tx-protocol-sighup-trigger
cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze -:stdin=ze-bgp:timeout=20s
await=stderr:contains=sighup reload complete
expect=stderr:pattern=imageserver: config applied.*image-directory=img-a
expect=stderr:pattern=imageserver: config applied.*image-directory=img-b
cmd=foreground:seq=3:exec=le test fixture client/http-get http://127.0.0.1:$PORT/install/image/only-in-b.img content-of-img-b
expect=stderr:contains=OK: http GET served content-of-img-b
reject=stderr:contains=reload error
reject=stderr:pattern=panic
